ck  in a never-ending past  when I look at the challenges of today  Russia's warned Ukraine  the blackmail through energy  the pressures of our way of life  then I know that we are all being tested  today whether we defend democracy  whether we are steadfest united  and determined each and every one of us  is part of our resilience  it's up to us to protect our future  it is up to us to make democracy prevail  it is up to us to stand in unity and  therefore long-live Europe and many  thanks for your attention  [Applause]  [Music]

